    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/8ffe6eed6d8239b1a9b21fa1e9de8778.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the post-apocalyptic world with your friends in search of bunkers, limited to a specific location in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/fd81ba22d2e7ac102dac08f13230ef4e.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/fd81ba22d2e7ac102dac08f13230ef4e.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/fd81ba22d2e7ac102dac08f13230ef4e.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/b98b1f7a4fe3ac317b42a98eed4ae0ce.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span>Delve deep into bunkers, scavenging for essential resources, crafting materials, and useful items like the limited selection of flashlights or crowbars found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/34b1db1812a8557e7a9de9d911b8a2cb.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/34b1db1812a8557e7a9de9d911b8a2cb.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/34b1db1812a8557e7a9de9d911b8a2cb.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/aca7e042a1dec27bebbf40602559cb2d.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/aca7e042a1dec27bebbf40602559cb2d.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/aca7e042a1dec27bebbf40602559cb2d.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/86a0c84332ad57376f0e51238fc9494b.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span>Experiment with crafting items using only the available resources, enhancing your survival chances in this isolated location. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6551a0c5673101f77b37946846140d8b.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6551a0c5673101f77b37946846140d8b.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6551a0c5673101f77b37946846140d8b.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/88111b87794cf437974217ab28c90cf3.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/88111b87794cf437974217ab28c90cf3.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/88111b87794cf437974217ab28c90cf3.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/b5506143ddaee2869afba5075f411178.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span>Avoid traps with your friends as you navigate the bunker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/3f1a8d9d44c63394061e56967237c35a.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/3f1a8d9d44c63394061e56967237c35a.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/3f1a8d9d44c63394061e56967237c35a.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c0ad1e5249b8a8b8f3e22d6d1780e572.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span> Stay alert around the demo's limited variety of monsters that emerged after the nuclear apocalypse\u2014or interact with them at your own risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/670edde917a121db09068a81d2dccada.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/670edde917a121db09068a81d2dccada.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/670edde917a121db09068a81d2dccada.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/3b3ef55a0168bf0b6241c4d2fe87eade.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span>The train constantly requires fuel\u2014burn items you collect to keep it running, or risk losing everything. Remember, every resource counts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/199a58d21cbfd056ef73808b6d50ad85.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/199a58d21cbfd056ef73808b6d50ad85.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/199a58d21cbfd056ef73808b6d50ad85.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/67f75b6f32cbbd114d606ddb9313f13a.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span>If your raid goes well, extract your loot safely from the bunker and prepare for another run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/85b14ff360355b75b3e6dca7b7e1e905.poster.avif?t=1754417013\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/85b14ff360355b75b3e6dca7b7e1e905.webm?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/85b14ff360355b75b3e6dca7b7e1e905.mp4?t=1754417013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/cd831046affb301a99d86fb33af25125.avif?t=1754417013\" width=609 height=100 /></span>Repeat these actions in the demo and enjoy endless fun with friends as you work together to survive this challenging location.</p>",
